-- Static reference data (competition structure, geography),
-- metropolitan France only. Order respects foreign keys:
-- regions -> departments -> leagues -> committees -> gyms -> clubs.
-- No contact details: phones, emails and presidents are FFBB's to
-- publish, and the site links to each organisation's FFBB page.

